[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3843946272","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115845#issuecomment-3843946272","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115845","id":3843946272,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7lHfcg","user":{"login":"ScatteredComet","id":120208759,"node_id":"U_kgDOByo9dw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/120208759?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScatteredComet","html_url":"https://github.com/ScatteredComet","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScatteredComet/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScatteredComet/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScatteredComet/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScatteredComet/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScatteredComet/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScatteredComet/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScatteredComet/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScatteredComet/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScatteredComet/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-03T22:11:28Z","updated_at":"2026-02-03T22:33:40Z","body":"Ah. Looking at blame the issue this PR is trying to fix actually appears to be a regression between\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blame/c58080299a038d7cfcba7036bd969434ced39093/editor/editor_help.cpp\r\n\r\nand \r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blame/9fae65404a223a86816685b0b4036a57b8f976b7/editor/editor_help.cpp\r\n\r\nThe first commit has the correct behaviour (and correct screenshots are shown in the PRs); the second one defaults to all right arrows. Specifically, the logic for `_add_type_icon` and `_update_doc` was refactored / updated, and how fallbacks are used seems to have changed.\r\n\r\nIf we want to fix this regression to what it was before, then it should only default to the cube if the class inherits from object (and be a right arrow if not).\r\n\r\nHaving a quick flick through the docs, it looks like all classes which dont inherit from object have a custom icon anyways, so I don't think this will actually change anything with the current docs. If it should still be included, let me know and I can add an if / else check","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3843946272/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3867237031","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115845#issuecomment-3867237031","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115845","id":3867237031,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7mgVqn","user":{"login":"ScatteredComet","id":120208759,"node_id":"U_kgDOByo9dw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/120208759?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScatteredComet","html_url":"https://github.com/ScatteredComet","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScatteredComet/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScatteredComet/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScatteredComet/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScatteredComet/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScatteredComet/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScatteredComet/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScatteredComet/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScatteredComet/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScatteredComet/received_events","type":"User","user_v